   "id": 616382,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "“Mob rule in Little Rock menaces the very safety of the United States and the free world.” This quotation is from",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1173495,
     "content_html": "the Supreme Court decision in <i>Brown v. Board of Education</i> (1954)"
    },
    {
     "id": 1173494,
     "content_html": "Arkansas Governor Orval Faubus’s decision to call the National Guide to prevent the Little Rock Nine from attending Central High School"
    },
    {
     "id": 1173493,
     "content_html": "the central tenet of Thurgood Marshall’s argument before the Supreme Court"
    },
    {
     "id": 1173496,
     "content_html": "President Eisenhower’s justification to send American troops into Little Rock"
    }
   ],
